<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Shrestha 💜</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body>

<div id="particles"></div>

<!-- Welcome Screen -->
<section id="welcome">

<div class="glass">

<h1>🎉 Happy Birthday</h1>

<h2>Shrestha 💜</h2>

<p>
A little surprise from your best friend...
</p>

<button id="startBtn">
Open Your Surprise 💜
</button>

</div>

</section>

<!-- Main Website -->

<div id="main" style="display:none;">

<header>

<h1>
Happy Birthday Shrestha 🎂
</h1>

<p>
Made with ❤️ by Harman
</p>

</header>

<!-- Countdown -->

<section class="card">

<h2>⏳ Countdown</h2>

<div id="countdown"></div>

</section>

<!-- Music -->

<section class="card">

<h2>🎵 Friendship Song</h2>

<p>
Click below to play your favourite Hindi friendship song.
</p>

<button id="musicBtn">
▶ Play Music
</button>

<audio id="song" controls style="display:none;">
<source src="music/song.mp3" type="audio/mp3">
</audio>

</section>

<!-- Gallery -->

<section class="card">

<h2>📸 Our Beautiful Memories</h2>

<div class="slider">

<img id="slide" src="photos/photo1.jpg">

</div>

</section>

<!-- Birthday Letter -->

<section class="card">

<h2>💌 A Letter For You</h2>

<p>

Happy Birthday, Shrestha 💜

You are one of the most special people in my life.

Thank you for every laugh,
every memory,
every late-night conversation,
and every moment that became unforgettable because of you.

May your smile always stay bright,
your dreams come true,
and your heart always stay happy.

I feel lucky to have a friend like you.

I love you so much as my best friend.

Happy Birthday once again.

Forever your friend,

❤️ Harman

</p>

</section>

<!-- Games Placeholder -->

<section class="card">

<h2>🎮 Games Coming Next...</h2>

<p>

Memory Quiz

Guess the Emoji

Birthday Trivia

Photo Puzzle

</p>

</section>

</div>

<script src="script.js"></script>

</body>

</html>
<!-- ================= MEMORY QUIZ ================= -->

<section class="card">

<h2>🧠 Memory Quiz</h2>

<div id="quiz">

<h3 id="question"></h3>

<div id="options"></div>

<button onclick="nextQuestion()">Next Question ➜</button>

<p id="score"></p>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ================= EMOJI GAME ================= -->

<section class="card">

<h2>😀 Guess The Emoji</h2>

<div id="emojiGame">

<h3 id="emojiQuestion">🎂🎁🎉</h3>

<input
type="text"
id="emojiAnswer"
placeholder="Type your answer">

<br><br>

<button onclick="checkEmoji()">

Submit

</button>

<p id="emojiResult"></p>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ================= BIRTHDAY TRIVIA ================= -->

<section class="card">

<h2>🎂 Birthday Trivia</h2>

<div id="trivia">

<p>

What is Shrestha's birthday?

</p>

<button onclick="correctTrivia()">

5 August

</button>

<button onclick="wrongTrivia()">

15 August

</button>

<button onclick="wrongTrivia()">

25 July

</button>

<p id="triviaResult"></p>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ================= PHOTO PUZZLE ================= -->

<section class="card">

<h2>🧩 Photo Puzzle</h2>

<p>

Click the button to shuffle the picture.

Arrange it back to complete the memory!

</p>

<img

src="photos/photo3.jpg"

id="puzzleImage"

width="250"

style="border-radius:15px;">

<br><br>

<button onclick="shufflePuzzle()">

Shuffle Puzzle

</button>

</section>

<!-- ================= FINAL SURPRISE ================= -->

<section class="card final">

<h1>

🎆 One Last Surprise 🎆

</h1>

<p>

Dear Shrestha,

No matter how many birthdays come,

I hope we always stay together,

laugh together,

and create more beautiful memories.

You are truly one of the most precious people in my life.

Thank you for being YOU.

💜

</p>

<button onclick="showFireworks()">

Open Final Surprise 🎁

</button>

</section>

<!-- Fireworks Screen -->

<div id="fireworksScreen">

<h1>

🎉 HAPPY BIRTHDAY SHRESTHA 💜

</h1>

<h2>

Best Friends Forever 👭

</h2>

<p>

Made with lots of ❤️ by Harman

</p>

<button onclick="closeFireworks()">

Back

</button>

</div>

<footer>

<p>

© 2026 • Made with ❤️ by Harman

</p>

</footer>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Birthday Website Admin</title>

<style>
body{
font-family:Poppins,Arial,sans-serif;
background:#6a0dad;
color:white;
padding:20px;
}

.card{
background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);
padding:20px;
border-radius:15px;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

input{
width:100%;
padding:10px;
margin:8px 0;
border-radius:8px;
border:none;
}

button{
padding:10px 20px;
border:none;
border-radius:8px;
cursor:pointer;
margin:5px;
background:white;
color:#6a0dad;
font-weight:bold;
}

textarea{
width:100%;
height:250px;
padding:10px;
border-radius:10px;
font-family:monospace;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<h1>💜 Birthday Website Admin</h1>

<div class="card">

<h2>Add Quiz Question</h2>

<input id="q" placeholder="Question">

<input id="o1" placeholder="Option 1">
<input id="o2" placeholder="Option 2">
<input id="o3" placeholder="Option 3">
<input id="o4" placeholder="Option 4">

<input id="ans" placeholder="Correct Answer">

<button onclick="addQuiz()">

Add Question

</button>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Add Emoji Game</h2>

<input id="emoji" placeholder="Emoji (Example: 🎂🎁🎉)">

<input id="emojiAns" placeholder="Answer">

<button onclick="addEmoji()">

Add Emoji

</button>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Generated quiz.json</h2>

<textarea id="quizOutput"></textarea>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Generated emoji.json</h2>

<textarea id="emojiOutput"></textarea>

</div>

<script>

let quiz=[];

let emoji=[];

function addQuiz(){

quiz.push({

question:document.getElementById("q").value,

options:[

document.getElementById("o1").value,

document.getElementById("o2").value,

document.getElementById("o3").value,

document.getElementById("o4").value

],

answer:document.getElementById("ans").value

});

document.getElementById("quizOutput").value=

JSON.stringify(quiz,null,2);

}

function addEmoji(){

emoji.push({

emoji:document.getElementById("emoji").value,

answer:document.getElementById("emojiAns").value

});

document.getElementById("emojiOutput").value=

JSON.stringify(emoji,null,2);

}

</script>
<section class="card">

<h2>🎂 Birthday Cake</h2>

<div class="cake">

<div id="flame1" class="flame"></div>
<div id="flame2" class="flame"></div>
<div id="flame3" class="flame"></div>

🎂

</div>

<br>

<button onclick="blowCandles()">
🎂 Blow the Candles
</button>

</section>

<div id="birthdayMessage">

<h1>🎉 Happy Birthday Shrestha 💜</h1>

<p>

May all your dreams come true!

Thank you for being my best friend ❤️

</p>

</div><div id="floatingContainer"></div>
</body>
</html>
<section id="ending">

<h1>🎉 Congratulations! 🎉</h1>

<h2>

You completed the Birthday Adventure 💜

</h2>

<p>

Happy Birthday Shrestha ❤️

Thank you for being

my best friend.

May your life always be

filled with happiness,

success,

love,

and beautiful memories.

You deserve the best.

Forever Friends 💜

Love,

Harman ❤️

</p>

<button onclick="location.reload()">

🔄 Replay Surprise

</button>

</section>
